    ADEZBDEZCDEZFABCGHZGHZACBGHZGHZABGHCGHACGHBGHZRSUAUCIQRSJTUBAGBCKLMABCNQSRU
    DUCIACBNOP $.

  $( Commutative/associative law.  (Contributed by Scott Fenton,
     3-Jan-2013.) $)
