     product of two products.  (Contributed by AV, 4-Mar-2023.) $)
  mul4r $p |- ( ( ( A e. CC /\ B e. CC ) /\ ( C e. CC /\ D e. CC ) ) ->
              ( ( A x. B ) x. ( C x. D ) ) =
                 ( ( A x. D ) x. ( C x. B ) ) ) $=
    ( cc wcel cmul wceq mulcom adantl oveq2d mul4 ancom2s simplr simprl mulcomd
    wa co 3eqtrd ) AEFZBEFZQZCEFZDEFZQZQZABGRZCDGRZGRUGDCGRZGRZADGRZBCGRZGRZUKC
    BGRZGRUFUHUIUGGUEUHUIHUBCDIJKUBUDUCUJUMHABDCLMUFULUNUKGUFBCTUAUENUBUCUDOPKS
    $.

