         by David Moews, 28-Feb-2017.) $)
      subne0ad $p |- ( ph -> A =/= B ) $=
        ( cmin co cc0 wne subeq0ad necon3bid mpbid ) ABCGHZIJBCJFANIBCABCDEKLM
        $.
    $}

    ${
      neg11d.3 $e |- ( ph -> -u A = -u B ) $.
      $( If the difference between two numbers is zero, they are equal.
