    negdid $p |- ( ph -> -u ( A + B ) = ( -u A + -u B ) ) $=
      ( cc wcel caddc co cneg wceq negdi syl2anc ) ABFGCFGBCHIJBJCJHIKDEBCLM $.

    $( Distribution of negative over addition.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro,
