      EFGBCDNO $.

    $( Commutative/associative law for addition and subtraction.  (Contributed
       by Mario Carneiro, 27-May-2016.) $)
    addsub12d $p |- ( ph -> ( A + ( B - C ) ) = ( B + ( A - C ) ) ) $=
