    $( Value of division: if ` A ` and ` B ` are complex numbers with ` B `
       nonzero, then ` ( A / B ) ` is the (unique) complex number such that
       ` ( B x. x ) = A ` .  (Contributed by NM, 8-May-1999.)  (Revised by
       Mario Carneiro, 17-Feb-2014.) $)
    divval $p |- ( ( A e. CC /\ B e. CC /\ B =/= 0 ) ->
                   ( A / B ) = ( iota_ x e. CC ( B x. x ) = A ) ) $=
      ( vz vy cc wcel cc0 wne cdiv co cmul wceq crio csn cdif eldifsn riotabidv
      cv wa eqeq2 oveq1 eqeq1d df-div riotaex ovmpo sylan2br 3impb ) BFGZCFGZCH
      IZBCJKCASZLKZBMZAFNZMZUJUKTUICFHOPZGUPCFHQDEBCFUQESZULLKZDSZMZAFNUOJUSBMZ
      AFNUTBMVAVBAFUTBUSUARURCMZVBUNAFVCUSUMBURCULLUBUCRDEAUDUNAFUEUFUGUH $.

