      divmuld $p |- ( ph -> ( ( A / B ) = C <-> ( B x. C ) = A ) ) $=
        ( cc wcel cc0 wne cdiv co wceq cmul wb divmul syl112anc ) ABIJDIJCIJCKL
        BCMNDOCDPNBOQEGFHBDCRS $.

      $( A commutative/associative law for division.  (Contributed by Mario
