        DONBDCMNONPEFHGBCDQR $.

      $( A commutative/associative law for division.  (Contributed by Mario
         Carneiro, 27-May-2016.) $)
      div13d $p |- ( ph -> ( ( A / B ) x. C ) = ( ( C / B ) x. A ) ) $=
        ( cc wcel cc0 wne cdiv co cmul wceq div13 syl121anc ) ABIJCIJCKLDIJBCMN
        DONDCMNBONPEFHGBCDQR $.

      divdiv23d.5 $e |- ( ph -> C =/= 0 ) $.
      $( Swap denominators in a division.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro,
