    ( cr wcel cc0 clt wbr wa w3a wceq wo cmul co cle ltmul1 cc wb recn remulcl
    wne adantr gt0ne0 jca mulcan2 syl3an bicomd orbi12d 3adant3 3adant2 3adant1
    leloe leloed 3adant3r 3bitr4d ) ADEZBDEZCDEZFCGHZIZJZABGHZABKZLZACMNZBCMNZG
    HZVEVFKZLZABOHZVEVFOHZVAVBVGVCVHABCPVAVHVCUPAQEUQBQEUTCQEZCFUAZIVHVCRASBSUT
    VLVMURVLUSCSUBCUCUDABCUEUFUGUHUPUQVJVDRUTABULUIUPUQURVKVIRUSUPUQURJVEVFUPUR
    VEDEUQACTUJUQURVFDEUPBCTUKUMUNUO $.

  $( Multiplication of both sides of 'less than or equal to' by a positive
