      prcom eleqtri a1i fmpt3d ) BCEABFGZDBDHZAEZIJKZJILZABMNNDABCOUHUIEUEUFBEG
      UHIJLZUIIPEJPEUHUJEQRUGIJPPSTIJUAUBUCUD $.

