      simpr eleq1d ifbid simp3 1re 0re ifcli a1i fvmptd ) BCFZABGZDBFZHZEDEIZAF
      ZJKLZDAFZJKLZBABMNNZOUJUKUSEBUPPQULEABCRSUMUNDQZTZUOUQJKVAUNDAUMUTUAUBUCU
      JUKULUDUROFUMUQJKOUEUFUGUHUI $.
  $}

  $( The range of the indicator function is a subset of ` RR ` .  (Contributed
     by AV, 10-Apr-2026.) $)
  fvindre $p |- ( ( ( O e. Fin /\ A C_ O ) /\ X e. O )
                  -> ( ( ( _Ind ` O ) ` A ) ` X ) e. RR ) $=
    ( cfn wcel wss wa cc0 c1 cpr cr cind cfv pr01ssre indf ffvelcdmda sselid )
    BDEABFGZCBEGHIJZKCABLMMZMNRBSCTABDOPQ $.

  $( Value of the indicator function where it is ` 1 ` .  (Contributed by
