     25-Jan-2026.) $)
  indconst0 $p |- ( O e. V -> ( ( _Ind ` O ) ` (/) ) = ( O X. { 0 } ) ) $=
    ( wcel c0 cind cfv csn cxp cdif cc0 cun wss wceq 0ss indval2 mpan2 0xp dif0
    c1 a1i xpeq1i uneq12i 0un 3eqtrd ) ABCZDAEFFZDSGZHZADIZJGZHZKZDAUJHZKZUMUED
    ALUFULMANDABOPULUNMUEUHDUKUMUGQUIAUJARUAUBTUNUMMUEUMUCTUD $.

  $( Indicator of the whole set.  (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux,
