  4m1e3 $p |- ( 4 - 1 ) = 3 $=
    ( c4 c3 c1 3cn ax-1cn df-4 mvrraddi ) ABCDEFG $.

  $( 5 - 1 = 4.  (Contributed by AV, 6-Sep-2021.) $)
