    ( cn0 cpnf csn cun cxnn0 ssun1 df-xnn0 sseqtrri ) AABCZDEAIFGH $.

  $( A standard nonnegative integer is an extended nonnegative integer.
     (Contributed by AV, 10-Dec-2020.) $)
