                   -> ( F o. ( S repeatS N ) ) = ( ( F ` S ) repeatS N ) ) $=
      ( vx wcel cn0 wf w3a cc0 cfzo co creps cfv cmpt wa wceq 3adant3 cvv simpr
      ccom simpl1 simpl2 repswsymb syl3anc fveq2d mpteq2dva simp3 repsf syl2anc
