      VLUQURSVIVKRCDVJEUKTULUNUMGVDDUTUOUP $.

    $( Composite shift operations.  (Contributed by NM, 19-Aug-2005.)  (Revised
       by Mario Carneiro, 5-Nov-2013.) $)
    2shfti $p |- ( ( A e. CC /\ B e. CC ) -> ( ( F shift A ) shift B ) =
                ( F shift ( A + B ) ) ) $=
      ( vx vy vz vw cc wcel wa cv cmin co cshi wbr copab wb shftfval wceq caddc
      breqd ovex vex eleq1 oveq1 breq1d anbi12d breq2 anbi2d eqid brab ad2antrr
