    GBWPWRWQVLWNPVLABVTWEWMVBUNVCVDVMVEURVF $.

  $( Signum of a product.  (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 2-Oct-2018.) $)
  sgnmul $p |- ( ( A e. RR /\ B e. RR )
    -> ( sgn ` ( A x. B ) ) = ( ( sgn ` A ) x. ( sgn ` B ) ) ) $=
